<p id="A1.S2.I1.ix8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Epistemic vacuum.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.S2.I1.ix9" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><math id="A1.S2.I1.ix9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}_{\Omega}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Ω</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}_{\Omega}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 
